  "lesson_22_note_0": "Naming: <b>classes</b> &mdash; <code>UpperCamelCase</code>, singular (<code>NationalPark</code>); <b>properties</b> &mdash; <code>lowerCamelCase</code>, read as a phrase (<code>hasProtectiveZone</code>).",
