  },
  "lesson_22_note_1": "<code>rdfs:domain</code> is <b>not a check</b>. If something has <code>:capacity</code> it \"becomes\" a <code>:Hut</code>, even by mistake.",
  "@lesson_22_note_1": {
    "description": "Lesson 22 «RDFS: class, domain, range»: note box",
    "context": "html"
  },
  "lesson_22_note_2": "Do not mix up <code>rdf:Property</code> (RDF) and <code>rdfs:Class</code> (RDFS). A property is declared via <code>rdf:</code>, a class via <code>rdfs:</code>.",
  "@lesson_22_note_2": {
