    "context": "html"
  },
  "lesson_24_note_0": "Direction: <code>?c skos:broader kat:MZCHU</code> reads \"?c has parent MZCHU\", so <code>?c</code> is a <b>descendant</b>. For \"all descendants\" use <code>?c skos:broader+ kat:MZCHU</code>.",
