  },
  "lesson_24_note_1": "An area is <b>not</b> an instance of a concept. The link goes through a property: <code>bv:category/skos:broader*</code> &mdash; from the area to its category and up.",
  "@lesson_24_note_1": {
    "description": "Lesson 24 «SKOS: hierarchy via broader+»: note box",
    "context": "html"
  },
  "lesson_24_note_2": "The data is the file zchu-skos.ttl: vocabularies <code>kat:</code> (protection categories), <code>iucn:</code>, <code>optyp:</code>.",
