  "lesson_25_note_1": "SKOS rules the reasoner does <b>not</b> check: &le;1 prefLabel per language; prefLabel and altLabel differ; every concept is <code>inScheme</code>; <code>broader</code> has no cycles; every concept has a <code>definition</code>.",
