  "lesson_2_note_0": "<code>a</code> may only be written <b>in the property position</b> (the middle of a triple): <code>:SpotA a :Spot</code>. It cannot be a subject or an object.",
  "@lesson_2_note_0": {
    "description": "Lesson 2 «a, ; and ,»: note box",
