  "lesson_3_task": "Describe <code>:Area1</code> with four value lines (numbers and booleans without quotes, strings in quotes, dates as <code>\"…\"^^xsd:date</code>): <code>:areaHa</code> 9.1887 (decimal), <code>:geometryChanged</code> the date 2005-01-20 (<code>xsd:date</code>), <code>:hasOverlap</code> false, <code>:aopkCode</code> the string <code>\"110\"</code>.",
