    "description": "Lesson 76 «Task 1 – isolatedTo in another range»: hint 2",
    "context": "html"
  },
  "lesson_76_task": "The property <code>uiaa-s:isolatedTo</code> points to the nearest higher summit. Return all summits whose nearest higher summit lies <b>in a different range</b>. For each, output its name, its range, and the name and range of the nearest higher summit. Columns: <code>?name</code>, <code>?range</code>, <code>?higherName</code>, <code>?higherRange</code>. <div class=\"small\">Data: <code>four-thousanders.ttl</code> (82 summits). Prefixes: <code>uiaa-s: &lt;https://www.theuiaa.org/4000-alps/schema/&gt;</code>, <code>uiaa: &lt;https://www.theuiaa.org/4000-alps/summit/&gt;</code>. Ranges (<code>uiaa-s:inRange</code>) are bare IRIs with no names; output the IRI itself.</div>",
  "@lesson_76_task": {
    "description": "Lesson 76 «Task 1 – isolatedTo in another range»: task statement",
    "context": "html"
  },
  "lesson_76_title": "Task 1 – isolatedTo in another range",
  "@lesson_76_title": {
    "description": "Lesson 76 «Task 1 – isolatedTo in another range»: title"
  },
  "lesson_77_hint_0": "String to number: <code>xsd:integer(STR(?p))</code> (BIND), then <code>FILTER (?n &gt; 300)</code>.",
